SUMMARY:Friday Nights at OMCA with Los Tranquilos
LOCATION:Oakland Museum\, 1000 Oak St\, Oakland\, CA 94607
DESCRIPTION:Live Music by Los Tranquilos\, Disco Dance Lesson with Soulchil
 d\, Caja Mágica’s All-Vinyl DJ Set\, Bike East Bay Community Tabling\, 
 and Gallery Chats Step into an evening of nostalgic rhythms\, movement\, a
 nd community connection this Friday Night at OMCA. The Garden Stage comes 
 alive with Los Tranquilos\, a California group blending the romantic soul\
 , psychedelia\, and classic grooves of 1960s and ’70s Latin America. Wit
 h soulful melodies\, rock influences\, and timeless rhythms\, their perfor
 mance celebrates the rich musical traditions that continue to inspire gene
 rations.\nhttps://museumca.org/event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-los-tranqu
 ilos/\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://museumca.org/event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-los-tranquilos/
END:VEVENT
