SUMMARY:Special Guest Gallery Chat: Mildred Howard and Adrian Burrell
LOCATION:Oakland Museum\, 1000 Oak St\, Oakland\, CA 94607
DESCRIPTION:Special Guest Gallery Chat: Mildred Howard and Adrian Burrell |
  MoAD Nexus Black Art Week In celebration of MoAD Nexus Black Art Week\, w
 e invite you to a Special Guest Gallery Chat with artists Mildred Howard a
 nd Adrian Burrell (featured in former OMCA Special Exhibition Black Spaces
 : Reclaim & Remain). Moderated by OMCA’s Senior Director of Marketing\, 
 Advancement\, Engagement\, Autumn King\, this engaging conversation brings
  together the two artists to share their creative practices and perspectiv
 es. Presented in partnership with MoAD Nexus Black Art Week\, the conversa
 tion offers an opportunity to connect with the artists and explore their w
 ork in conversation with the Museum community.\nhttps://museumca.org/event
 /special-guest-gallery-chat-mildred-howard-and-adrian-burrell/\nFrom Pushp
 in Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://museumca.org/event/special-guest-gallery-chat-mildred-howard-an
 d-adrian-burrell/
END:VEVENT
